    - Generates low-velocity (35-45) ghost notes on offbeats (beats 2-and & 4-and) for natural acoustic groove.
    - Automatic octave drop for pitches above 44 to maintain solid sub-bass weight.
  * Interactive Live Real-Time Jam Engine:
    - JZLiveJamEngine monitors live MIDI In notes, computes active pitches, and identifies chords and inversions in real time.
  * Enhanced UI (src/Dialogs/AutoAccompanimentDialog.h & .cpp):
    - Real-time global key display in dialog header.
    - Song Section controls (Auto / Intro / Verse / Chorus / Bridge / Outro) and Bass Articulation Feel.
    - Checkboxes for Smooth Voice Leading, Bass Ghost Notes, and Smart Auto-Mixer Presets.

23-10-2026 Raja Zahidi
- Feature & Music Intelligence: Smart Music Intelligence & Session Band Hub (Pro Edition):
  * Advanced Harmonic Accuracy (src/AutoAccompaniment.h & .cpp):
    - Half-Bar Split Detection: Tracks mid-measure chord changes (e.g. ii-V) ensuring bass, rhythm strums, riffs, and solos track harmonic shifts accurately.
    - Chord Inversion Disambiguation: Identifies 1st, 2nd, and 3rd chord inversions and slash chords (e.g. C/E, G/B, C/G, G7/F) without mistaking bass notes for chord roots.
