    - Tab 3 [Riffs & Hooks]: Chord-scale harmonic riffs (Blues Rock boogie, Funk brass hits, Hard Rock palm-muted riffs, Synthwave 16th rolling bass, Jazz Bebop chromatic enclosures).
    - Tab 4 [Auto-Solo Lead]: Intelligent solo generator with chord-scale matching (Dorian, Mixolydian, Lydian, Blues), 2-bar Call-and-Response phrasing, blues note slides, and phrase density controls (Sparse, Balanced, Virtuoso).
    - Simultaneous multi-layer generation or individual tab generation.
    - Full song-wide Undo support (gpProject->NewUndoBuffer()).
    - Menu shortcut 'Auto-Accompaniment (Smart Band)...' (Ctrl+B) in Tools menu (TrackFrame) and Edit menu (PianoFrame).

